flowchart TD
    MENU[ConnectionMenuUI] -->|StartHost/Client| NM[NetworkManager + UnityTransport]
    NM --> SEL[Seleccion de personaje]
    SEL -->|ElegirPersonaje| GSM[GameSessionManager servidor]
    GSM -->|SpawnWithOwnership| P[PlayerZendre / PlayerAyla]
    P -->|IsOwner| CAM[camara + input activos solo del dueno]
